item.description:
Zenzap is launching AI Agents for Work, a platform where employees and AI agents share group chats to coordinate tasks across connected business apps.

For example, agents could qualify a lead in HubSpot, find the right sales rep, request approval, schedule a demo in Google Calendar and update the CRM. The team can follow and direct the workflow in the same conversation.

@zenzap_chat users can create an agent without coding in under 90 seconds, with controls over which tools it can access and which actions need human approval. https://x.com/GuyWeissZZ/status/2110387887023751398/video/1

Aonic Club has opened its waitlist, aiming to sell protein and supplements at cost using AI in sourcing and operations.

It says membership fees replace product markups. Founding members pay $49 for year one, then $149.

@maxjmeier @AonicClub
